# Mod list (committed). Workshop IDs -> WorkshopItems=, Mod IDs -> Mods= (case-sensitive, load order).
# Missing Workshop items are downloaded by pz-init with SteamCMD before the server starts.
# ========================================================
# Modpack (Build 42.21). Workshop IDs -> WorkshopItems=, Mod IDs -> Mods=. Mod IDs are case-sensitive.
# Removed: 3250640567 Atmospheric Scary Sounds (deleted from the Workshop),
#          2840805724 SOTO (author: does not work in B42 multiplayer),
#          2106657533 Pillow's Random Scenarios (last update Jan 2025, before B42 had multiplayer).
# Added:   3396446795 Moodle Framework (required by Dynamic Traits, loads before it),
#          2459400130 Dynamic Traits and Expanded Moodles (SOTO replacement, B42.20-42.22 dedicated),
#          3821934230 UH-1 Huey (+UH1Viewpoint) - the model Visible Helicopter Events needs,
#          3825724093 DeadWorks Vehicle Framework (required by the current 3D RVs; legacy GridRV IDs are frozen),
#          music: 3402491515 Tsar's Common Library, 3397198968 True Music B42, 3068955583 True Music: Mixtape
#          Megapack (~1.1 GB, 800+ songs released before July 1993), 3631572046 True Music Radio 42,
#          3398874593 True Music Jukebox 42,
#          3761077099 Vanilla Firearms Expansion [CLASSIC] (~40 firearms; author: built and tested on a dedicated PvP server),
#          3813194971 Viewpoint - Advanced Throwables (listed by Recoil & ADS as required; grenades and molotovs no
#          longer land at your feet in first/third person; server logic is plain Lua),
#          3811752923 Military Drop (radio supply airdrops, supply-helicopter crashes, recon/clearance orders;
#          B42.21 MP, server-authoritative) with what it requires: 3694097672 TooltipLib, 3817018338 Belt
#          Walkie-Talkie (batman_BeltRadio), 3811010882 Signal Smoke (batman_SignalSmoke). Load order as listed.
# Not added: 3815033432 Silent View(point) and 3830113693 Black Outlines Fix, which Steam lists as required by the
#          Silent viewpoint Enhanced shader pack (its own page only recommends the fix and does not mention Silent
#          View(point)): Silent View(point) keeps the world in 65-100% fog (Silent Hill monsters spawn in fog), the fix
#          declares the same Mod ID as the shader pack.
# 2026-11-04: 3812616893 Viewpoint - Interface (ViewpointUI), 3817294484 Viewpoint - Roofs (removed
#          2026-11-05 at the user's request; the 6282 pack's own roof/tent models are used again), 3781616141 Vehicle Aim Roof Fix (CarRoofFix),
#          3775549570 Alice's Weapon Sling (+ RadialMenu addon). QOL switched to its ProjectViewpointQOLLegacy0.1.6
#          sub-mod: since 2026-11-03 the main ProjectViewpointQOL needs Viewpoint 0.1.7 and switches itself off on 0.1.6.1.
# Also 2026-11-04: VisibleHolsterBeltTomb (3827336316's own Tomb's Body fit sub-mod; its page says to tick it with
#          Tomb's Player Body Overhaul), after TombBodyCompat as its mod.info asks.
# Also 2026-11-04 (from the 0.1.7 collection 2690796635): 3823979843 Ceiling Lights (after the model packs, as its
#          mod.info asks), Detailed Vanilla Models parts 2,4-9 + 3D Gloves (DetailedModelsGloves requires TombBody),
#          2956146279 Rain Cleans Blood, 3780639614 Push Vehicle, 3387539308 Auto Mechanics, 2940354599 Fitness & Workout
#          Overhaul (+ Treadmill & BenchPress; it wraps ISFitnessAction like Dynamic Traits does and leaves mood bonuses to
#          DT when DT is on), 2896041179 errorMagnifier with what it requires: 3077900375 Mod Update and Alert System. Both load before True Music:
#          the Alert System redefines MainScreen:onEnterFromGame without calling the previous one, so the Jukebox's
#          wrapper must come after it.
# Load order fixed 2026-11-04 per mod.info loadModAfter: VisibleHelicopterEvent after UH1/UH1Viewpoint,
#          ViewpointAdvancedThrowables after ProjectViewpointADS.
# Not added (2026-11-04): 3409723807 UH-1B + 3783444342 Aviation Core (MP: engine cuts out after takeoff, duplicate
#          spawns; we already have the flyable UH-1 Huey), 3819018807 Right Click Fix (RMB already used by Isometric
#          No More), 3818297469 DayZ Health HUD (duplicates Interface HUD; per-player "reveal Knox infection" option).
# Viewpoint 0.1.7: scripts/server.sh swaps ProjectViewpointQOLLegacy0.1.6 -> ProjectViewpointQOL and drops isometricnomore
#          (merged into 0.1.7) by itself once the downloaded Viewpoint is no longer 0.1.6.x (VIEWPOINT_COMPAT in .env).
# Added 2026-11-05: 3268487204 Bandits NPC (Bandits2): hostile human raiders, has its own 42.21 build, "single and
#          multiplayer" per its page. Its incompatible= list names nothing in this pack. It wraps ISBaseTimedAction.perform
#          the same chained way as The Only Cure; Silent Hill monsters are its own SHM_* zombies, and SHM already skips
#          bandits. Spawn rate halved in config/SandboxVars.lua. Not yet run on our server.
# Changed 2026-11-05: TombBodyTex -> TombBodyTexNUDE (same Workshop item 3429790870; the author describes it as
#          female nipples + pubic hair, no explicit nudity). Body textures load at game start, see README.
# Removed 2026-11-05 at the user's request: 3812702301 Viewpoint Advanced Movement (+ its server part), 3823979843
#          Ceiling Lights.
# Added 2026-11-05: 3656190498 Reactive Sound Events (ReactiveSE, own 42.21 build): distant sounds lead to scenes you can
#          find, plus a survivor radio station on 112.4 MHz (True Music Radio uses 88-108, Military Drop 120-170). Runs
#          alongside the vanilla meta events; no shared files or overridden functions with the pack. Author's defaults.
# Changed 2026-11-05: 3580276809 The Only Cure -> 3818733381 The Only Cure+ (Field Surgery), a fork that keeps the
#          original's save data (TheOnlyCurePlus; TheOnlyCurePlusTombBody fits stumps/prostheses to Tomb's body, after
#          TombBody*). Its overrides shared with Alice's Sling, QOL, Insurgent and Bandits all chain.
# Added 2026-11-05: 3814398576 Viewpoint - Surface Fix (ViewpointSurface: wall/ceiling textures in 3D) and 3817413313
#          Immersive Driving (camera and hands in cars). Java client parts; the Viewpoint methods they share with
#          Advanced Flashlight, Isometric No More, Living Props, Recoil & ADS, 3D RVs and Vehicle Interiors are all
#          ZombieBuddy enter/exit hooks, not replacements, but untested together: Surface Fix and Isometric No More both may
#          skip WorldMesher.drawnElsewhere, and ADS and Immersive Driving both adjust Camera.eye. 3630494926 Bandits Radio Expansion (BanditsRadioExp: surrender,
#          bandit radio calls, weapon drops, gore with TOC+). It ships its own copies of TOC+'s stump clothing and loads
#          after TheOnlyCurePlusTombBody by its mod.info, so stumps keep the Tomb-fitted models (all 36 stump models
#          it names exist in TOC+) but use its own stump textures instead of the Tomb body texture.
# Not added (2026-11-05): 3811344119 Viewpoint - Light Fix (flashlight range and headlights; overlaps Advanced
#          Flashlight, which already sets flashlight beams, and patches the same shader and torch methods).
# Added 2026-11-05 at the user's request: 3820965001 Viewpoint - Visceral (VisceralViewpoint: 3D wounds, dismemberment;
#          client Java; 3811472160 3D Blood VFX was removed in its favour the same day at the user's request),
#          3827957976 Project Real Limbs (RealLimbs: hit physics; its page lists Visceral, Blood FX, Bandits and Viewpoint
#          add-ons as compatible; the hitter's client runs the physics), 3531611692 Lethal Stealth (RET_LethalStealth: prone
#          and crouch with an aim bonus), 3818096743 Knox Wildlife (beta: bears, coyotes, elk, bobcats, boars). Not
#          added: 3677017550 Tactical Hold, 3680633169 Tactical Pistol Hold (user declined). All their Lua overrides that other mods also touch chain; no shared files.
# Added 2026-11-05: DeadWorksDaleRV, the optional Dale's Chieftain RV inside 3820158673 (needs the framework, Nomad
#          and PZVoxelStudioViewpoint, all on).
# Added 2026-11-05: 3747745835 Moodle Effects Explained (MoodleEffectsExplainedB42: moodle tooltips with numbers and
#          what to do, Russian included; on 42.20.2+ the main ID also covers Dynamic Traits, its DTEM sub-mod is legacy).
# Added 2026-11-05: 3728775267 Better Vehicle Dynamics (BetterVehicleDynamics: torque curves, surface/weather grip; its
#          Java runs on each driver's client via ZombieBuddy, none of its 12 hooks is shared with the pack; author's
#          defaults), 3817135911 Viewpoint - Physics & Collision (ViewpointPhysicsProps: rigid-body props, server-
#          authoritative; shares enter/exit hooks with Surface Fix, Living Props, Isometric No More, Advanced Throwables
#          and the 3D RVs, untested together), 3802372726 True Swimming (TrueSwimming; its perks.txt is merged with
#          TOC+'s by the engine's CustomPerks loader; its sit overrides chain with Lethal Stealth's).
# Added 2026-11-05 (looks): 3414634809 Spongie's Character Customisation (SPNCC, SPNCCDetails; not its vanilla faces
#          pack, which is incompatible with Tomb's textures), before TombBody as Tomb asks; TombBodyCustom (Tomb's extra
#          faces for Spongie, inside 3429790870); 3531765630 Tomb's Goth Skin (TombGothTexNUDE to match TombBodyTexNUDE,
#          TombGothMakeup, TombGothHair; after TombBodyCustom and FH); 3429700843 Yandere's Hairstyles, vanilla-body
#          variant (yandere'sanimehairstylesvanilla, needs FH; ~820 MB); 3549794747 Eyewear rework project, Tomb's-body
#          variant (after TombBodyCompat, so its glasses replace the compat patch's). hairstyles.xml is merged per mod.
# Added 2026-11-05 (looks and life): Frockin' Backstage! 3798146388 (library the Frockin mods require since
#          2026-10-08), Frockin Splendor! Vol.1-6 (3307376332, 3411888105, 3431256608, 3475347500, 3635394848, 3798149669)
#          and Frockin Stompers! 3736813592 (not its Vanilla Footwear Replacer), all BEFORE TombBodyCompat: Tomb's compat
#          patch ships Tomb-fitted copies of Frockin meshes and must load after every clothing mod it fits. 3555677825
#          Yandere's New Hairstyles (NewHairstylesForVanilla), 3782331835 Cute and Mythic Craft Bags, 3404392239 Large
#          Duffel Bag (no MP tag; craft-only reskin), 3815468401 Too Many Emotes, 3759676725 Fists of Survival (FightZ;
#          its perks.txt merges with TOC+ and True Swimming), 3592172476 Take A Bath And Shower (DepthMap fix + New),
#          3618557184 Here Goes the Sun (dawn/dusk light palettes via the climate). Shared Lua overrides chain.
# Added 2026-11-05: 3819082666 Viewpoint Stealth Sight (StealthSight: zombies see in front, less to the sides, hardly
#          behind; light, crouching, flashlight, smell and steps count. Java, patches IsoZombie.spotted per target and
#          the torch info; nothing else in the pack hooks those) and 3786073264 Stealth Attack (StealthAttackBySwas:
#          crouched melee hit on an unaware zombie from behind kills it, chance by Sneak level; the server applies the
#          kill). Not added: 3053929034 Yes' Improved Stealth v2 - it sets the zombie-wide 'useless' flag from the
#          sneaking player's client, so a zombie would ignore the whole group, not just the hidden player.
# ========================================================
